{"channelId":"UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","row":["Atlanta Esalen Massage",41,"As an Esalen Massage Therapist in Atlanta GA, I offer videos educational videos about Esalen Massage therapy. I specialize in Esalen massage: a full-body contemplative massage.  The hallmarks of Esalen massage are long flowing strokes, rocking, stretches, and holds. The goal of Esalen massage is to help the client enter into a deeply relaxed, meditative state.\n\nThe Esalen practitioner responds to the unique issues presented by the individual client, instead of imposing a particular protocol, form or set way of working. Each massage is customized to meet your personal needs in the moment.\n\nCreated at the Esalen Institute in Big Sur, CA, Esalen Massage was designed to give the client a sense of deep relaxation and integration of body, mind, and spirit.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:05.612Z","channelId":"UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8c3018f6578d555c47c34d8fa2bec591044d3d8409e59b0948dc515333adc75d","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"65faceb8dcca7f2e42837f91cad56968a1a5b0d978f82ff25142debf2d7679e6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:05.612Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":41,"raw":"41 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNq9m7KpKyoNetUkcfIvc0A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:05.612Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermin